# Do not commit plugin `src/main/resources`

Never stage, commit, or push changes under:

- `tang-source-plugin/src/main/resources/**`
- `../shopify/tangbuy-plugin/src/main/resources/**` (local clone path)
- any path matching `**/tangbuy-plugin/src/main/resources/**` or `**/tang-source-plugin/src/main/resources/**`

These files are environment/deploy config (Nacos, `application*.yml`, `schema.sql`, catalogs, etc.) and must stay out of git commits from agent work.

If a task requires editing them locally for debugging, keep changes unstaged and warn the user; do not include them in `git add` / commit.
